    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d321">

                <pb facs="0436" n="316" xml:id="pg316"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Minister Dawson.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Dapartment of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-02-06"><hi rendition="#italic">February 6,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 46.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I inclose the President’s full powers
                    authorizing you to sign the protocol with reference to the collection and
                    disbursement by the United States of the custom revenues of the Dominican
                    Republic, and confirm the telegram which I sent to you this morning in the
                    following language: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>The President has to-day telegraphed the President of Santo Domingo full
                            powers for you to sign protocol. See him and sign at once.</p>
                    </quote></p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">John Hay.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
